/*
 * A tentacle grabs your ankle and tries to drag you into the water. You can resist with an athletics check or banish it if you have the angel TF.
 * If you fail, you get pulled in. One of the teens at the campfire party might be try to help you.
 */
:: Fishing Beach Tentacle Event
You hear something slithering across the sand beneath you. Before you can step away, a wet tentacle coils around your ankle, and yanks you off your feet and towards the water.
<br><br>

<<if $angel gte 4 and $angelBanish gte 1>>
	<<link [[Banish the tentacle|Fishing Beach Tentacle Banish]]>><<angelBanishUse>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Try to pull away|Fishing Beach Tentacle Escape]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 600 1200>>


:: Fishing Beach Tentacle Banish
You focus your mind on the tentacle wrapping around your leg, then make an intricate gesture with your hand. <span class="green">The tentacle shimmers and recoils violently,</span> releasing you and slipping back into the water.
<br>
<<if beachCampfirePartyPresent()>>
	You stand on the shore, breathing hard, and look back at the campfire. The teenagers either didn't notice or are pretending that they didn't.
<<else>>
	You stand on the shore, breathing hard.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>

/* Fishing Todo: This should soak your clothing. If a teenager helped you, and you are exposed, they will offer you a towel to cover yourself with. If they didn't help you, there is a chance that one or two of them walk up and ask what all the commotion was about, and then try to take advantage of the PC */


:: Fishing Beach Tentacle Escape
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You twist your leg free and stumble to your feet and away from the waters edge.</span> You stand there catching your breath as waves crash in the surf before you.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	The tentacle yanks hard, <span class="red">you're pulled backward twards the water, your fingers digging into the sand and unable to gain purchase.</span>
	<<if beachCampfirePartyPresent()>>
		<<if $cool gte 160 and random(1, 2) is 1>>
			The teenagers by the fire fall silent, watching in shock. <<generatey1>><<person1>>One of them jumps up and runs toward you. "Hold on!" <<He>> shouts, splashing into the water.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Tentacle Rescue Attempt]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			The teenagers by the fire fall silent, watching you get dragged away. The last thing you see before the water closes around you is their faces, frozen in horror.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		The last thing you see before the water closes over you is the <<if Time.isBloodMoon()>>red <</if>>light of the moon reflecting on the wet sand.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Beach Tentacle Rescue Attempt
<<person1>>
<<if random(1, 5) is 1>>
	The <<person>> reaches for you, but you're already slipping beneath the surface. <<His>> hands come up empty, and you see the look of horror and helplessness on <<his>> face as the ocean swallows you.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Sea Tentacles]]>><<location "seadocks">><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The <<person>> wades deeper, reaching for your outstretched hand. <<His>> fingers brush yours, and suddenly <<he>> is pulling with all <<his>> strength. You get your feet under you, and together you stumble backward, out of the grasp of whatever was grabbing you.
	<br><br>

	You collapse on the sand, gasping and shaking.
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"Thank you," you quietly say.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Good timing," you manage to say.
	<<else>>
		"Thanks for that," you manage to say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> takes a step back, still catching <<his>> breath. "Yeah, of course." <<He>> glances toward the fire, then back at you. "Come on, sit with us. Warm up a bit."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Accept|Beach Party]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Beach]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<run stopFishingProp()>><</link>>
<</if>>




